    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c090710d38b6161952653d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用为我烦恼生日礼物喔！\r\n……真要说的话，\r\n我比较想要一起出门～之类的？",
      "source_fingerprint": "92e91f15a5d97b18ebe6195e116b391ac48ad558c0560ff5fbbf6b5dca8903d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:863db0dbe53ca355d93bdd57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，有新通知喔！\r\n无视通知是不对的喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c67e46d8665a1a6738c6df036f0fe9b00d69662ff34ee5c2192f9fcdf99d841",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f47b9b6172c5bf80b0f94c3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你收到礼物了呢！\r\n太好啦，恭喜你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "034baa5bc1dba7427e1e33fb67b7d116272f8aeb555e45be8dc12c9bda282c78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b39829386fa2300663fdafc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成！这是不是\r\n就是所谓的……太嗨了～！呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4d551c8efe7d8bf04e479af00329de55565cb47ffdfffadfbb42d8f148b0b91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95f715164649571f58496fc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说活动快开始了。\r\n注意可别因为太兴奋，\r\n而在正式活动时没力了喔～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f8aba3dfae8538a029c4eb9a2d0da427603462606c1783d036346ec6c9b6d5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7676a9d4bb65581497aa9233",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，正在举办活动嘛。\r\n全力享受吧！\r\n玩得最高兴的才是赢家嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f61962f96c1e88aaf991c2cfe62c3757d17801db26b385591addf63b165be305",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee8f68fcdb043d0491ce6e98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "转换心情再出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8afc2b301f226748509afde9ca3a87530c8dca15dbce5d0e22f3c3ebac71b6c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86c2593552c45b2fd061784e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提～升～！\r\n你的努力我都看在眼里喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82a5158dba79f57c518091ee921bb205d606dbfb91b3d3cc4d0647fa71258bbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73bef0db9f11f10ed7fbc7e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我对衣服没有很讲究，\r\n但多少会在意质感吧。\r\n毕竟从小被教导要挑选好的东西～",
      "source_fingerprint": "52a64f93f55674f3ff8a50db5b123f7abe88ef3748122839d570fdae0f9d9f8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26c178ae5a25322899185433",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目白家有御用的品牌……不过有一次\r\n看到假人模特儿也穿一样的装扮，\r\n觉得有～点不好意思！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2f312fa900eaf4eccfd80cda3a0a91d6ba199cd69291c87a473231299b614fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b718151aa826ae0f68f42798",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟太阳交换衣服的时候啊……\r\n呵呵，她把这个蝴蝶结绑得很大，\r\n看起来就像小狗一样，可爱极了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "afd7e1ad8527eb8534abe095c8b000fe3eb0f8b54eee443a277f5fceebeca647",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f433821792dabe5081fc014a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是可惜呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3520415b5d555e3854c82aedd9b2d95fb32dff1d72bffc0a7c58c7f78766c4e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:109cf66a88c6af86e1dd9c23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是属于大家的胜利呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bab6293f5c42b48de109897849e6fef83187957f8a71d5cfc8e3f38c381d65ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9e4195343fa474496a90f9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "转换心情再出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8afc2b301f226748509afde9ca3a87530c8dca15dbce5d0e22f3c3ebac71b6c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
